= The Democratic Party Challenges Erim

Although we manage to bring the MGP to our side, we fail to convince the AP parliamentary group to defy its chairman, Süleyman Demirel. The DP's motion therefore falls short. Erim's position remains precarious, but our efforts have irritated the military leadership and angered İnönü, who regards Ecevit's unilateral initiative as another challenge to his authority.

